<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760160/extras/f83258a1e5e7a6a2aa069fb240f5083a.poster.avif?t=1766509019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760160/extras/f83258a1e5e7a6a2aa069fb240f5083a.webm?t=1766509019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760160/extras/f83258a1e5e7a6a2aa069fb240f5083a.mp4?t=1766509019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HERE'S A TASTE OF WHAT YOU GET IN THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 unlockable heroes. Each with unique passive abilities and spells that allow you to change your game style with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of colourful and detailed cards and items to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 10 unique bosses, each requiring a special approach to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If the game feels too challenging, you can use card upgrades to make your playthrough an easier experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760160/extras/f45dcac39abf8c79b2b17c3d919a0f89.poster.avif?t=1766509019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760160/extras/f45dcac39abf8c79b2b17c3d919a0f89.webm?t=1766509019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760160/extras/f45dcac39abf8c79b2b17c3d919a0f89.mp4?t=1766509019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
